# MuJoCo design loop

- Keep tools → scenario → environment → core; scenario owns One-Piece integration.
- Read requirements, KDPs and model parameters from a pinned One-Piece revision.
- EN (reset, verifier, constraints) stays immutable during PI/R/E iterations.
- Automatic design variables: six mechanical parameters, motor family, three LQR Q groups and yaw gain only.
- R, timing, sensors, actuator limits, seeds and outcome gates are not proposal fields.
- Use the same saved controller K in CPU, GPU and replay paths.
- Compare CPU/GPU at fixed dt; never add half-step adjudication to new runs.
- E may revise bounded design-search strategy data, not the verifier or environment.
- Preserve failures, policy ancestry, budgets, evidence and keep/reject reasons.
- GPU unavailable means not run; CPU evidence cannot claim GPU verification.
- Offline/Fake LLM acceptance does not prove real LLM improvement.
